WEBVTT

00:12:59.829 --> 00:13:04.037
And then and then a mother who died,
I was really an orphan.

00:13:04.037 --> 00:13:08.787
And, you know, I had to go and find
those things, as you say.

00:13:08.787 --> 00:13:12.162
And yet I think part of maybe the
human journey is that like that

00:13:12.412 --> 00:13:13.871
I even think of my own kids,

00:13:13.871 --> 00:13:17.996
teenagers right now who are loved
and secure and living in

00:13:17.996 --> 00:13:20.996
a very happy home and have
wonderful lives.

00:13:21.037 --> 00:13:25.079
And yet what I know about them is that
that part of their journey is going to

00:13:25.079 --> 00:13:30.954
be finding their way and finding their
strength and finding their courage